1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 12]</font>

15
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Care for a drink?</font>

16
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:36,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back in my days
at the Court of Judicial Review,</font>

17
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:38,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd often share a jar with the lads.</font>

18
00:01:39,320 --> 00:01:40,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once the wine worked its magic,</font>

19
00:01:40,760 --> 00:01:42,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all my troubles simply melted away.</font>

20
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:43,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not a single worry left.</font>

21
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:49,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To be honest,</font>

22
00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's been a very long time</font>

23
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:56,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">since I've felt this way.</font>

24
00:01:58,240 --> 00:02:07,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

25
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:12,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

26
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:14,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we agreed.</font>

27
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:16,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once you tell him
Steward Zhou's autopsy results,</font>

28
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:16,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll leave right away.</font>

29
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

30
00:02:28,440 --> 00:02:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

31
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:53,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This bottle of medicine</font>

32
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can ease your internal injuries.</font>

33
00:02:59,120 --> 00:02:59,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I promise you</font>

34
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that I'll do everything in my power</font>

35
00:03:03,320 --> 00:03:04,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to help you recover.</font>

36
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:40,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

37
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:43,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">farewell.</font>

38
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:10,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If anyone dares to harm her,</font>

39
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:13,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will take their wretched life.</font>

40
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:45,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you say we'd drink?</font>

41
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:47,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Given your health, tea is better.</font>

42
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:56,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

43
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enter.</font>

44
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:02,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

45
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:03,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi has taken her own life.</font>

46
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give her a proper burial.</font>

47
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:11,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

48
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty.</font>

49
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Memorial]</font>

50
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the case report.</font>

51
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:20,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This time,</font>

52
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:22,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the matter was resolved smoothly.</font>

53
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Though you used Changle's situation</font>

54
00:06:25,080 --> 00:06:26,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to divert everyone's attention,</font>

55
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">many commoners will still harbor</font>

56
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:30,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">unfounded suspicions and spread rumors.</font>

57
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:32,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Moreover,</font>

58
00:06:33,280 --> 00:06:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changle has submitted
a letter of repentance to me.</font>

59
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:37,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She will be released tomorrow.</font>

60
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:38,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean, Your Majesty?</font>

61
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rumors spread like wildfire.</font>

62
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:42,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Better to guide than to block.</font>

63
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:44,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Shangsi Festival is near.</font>

64
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In your name,</font>

65
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:48,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">make a thousand Kongming Lanterns.</font>

66
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:50,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Consider it praying</font>

67
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:51,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the people's well-being
on my behalf.</font>

68
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As you command, Your Majesty.</font>

69
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:47,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In war, one must read the wind and rain.</font>

70
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Next time you forget your umbrella,</font>

71
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:50,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't bring you one.</font>

72
00:07:50,880 --> 00:07:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you'll have no one to bring it.</font>

73
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:01,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's small. Don't get wet.</font>

74
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:09,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did His Majesty say to you?</font>

75
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He asked me to release wishing lanterns</font>

76
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to pray for the people.</font>

77
00:08:14,520 --> 00:08:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why not</font>

78
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:16,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">come with me?</font>

79
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:18,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty asked you.</font>

80
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would you bring me along?</font>

81
00:08:20,200 --> 00:08:21,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everything must have
a beginning and an end.</font>

82
00:08:22,080 --> 00:08:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The rumor was started by you.</font>

83
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:24,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, tell me.</font>

84
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:25,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shouldn't you clean up the mess?</font>

85
00:08:29,080 --> 00:08:29,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

86
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Jinyu Chamber]</font>

87
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:43,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have me dressed like this.</font>

88
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if we're discovered?</font>

89
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:47,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you're worried,</font>

90
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when the time comes,</font>

91
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:50,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just bury your face in my chest.</font>

92
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:53,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At worst, it's just another tale</font>

93
00:08:53,520 --> 00:08:54,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of my romantic escapades.</font>

94
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:00,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are these?</font>

95
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:03,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These are notes
for the Kongming Lanterns.</font>

96
00:09:05,280 --> 00:09:06,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't you help me think</font>

97
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about what we should write?</font>

98
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:12,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Naturally, words of good fortune.</font>

99
00:09:13,640 --> 00:09:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Such as...</font>

100
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:15,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait, wait.</font>

101
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:19,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Abundant wealth and prosperity.</font>

102
00:09:22,560 --> 00:09:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Abundant wealth and prosperity]</font>

103
00:09:25,400 --> 00:09:25,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And then?</font>

104
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:27,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bountiful grain harvest.</font>

105
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:31,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bountiful...</font>

106
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Favorable weather]</font>

107
00:09:35,640 --> 00:09:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any more?</font>

108
00:09:37,920 --> 00:09:38,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't think of any.</font>

109
00:09:39,160 --> 00:09:39,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's stop.</font>

110
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:51,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could you forget this?</font>

111
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:57,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Focus on your writing.</font>

112
00:10:02,160 --> 00:10:05,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Blissful Union]</font>

113
00:10:06,280 --> 00:10:06,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Done.</font>

114
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:16,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the way, Wei,</font>

115
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:20,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've always wondered</font>

116
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:23,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how you overcame your fear of blood.</font>

117
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:28,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My mother's late husband
was also a coroner.</font>

118
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He knew many practitioners
of unorthodox arts.</font>

119
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:33,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Among them was a divine healer.</font>

120
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:36,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After my mother found me by the cliff,</font>

121
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:38,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she begged him to heal my face.</font>

122
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:40,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For an entire month,</font>

123
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he peeled back the skin on my face</font>

124
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:45,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and replaced it anew.</font>

125
00:10:46,560 --> 00:10:48,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had never seen so much blood.</font>

126
00:10:49,680 --> 00:10:50,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I got used to it,</font>

127
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the dizziness eventually faded.</font>

128
00:10:58,800 --> 00:10:59,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It must have been terribly painful.</font>

129
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:04,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It doesn't hurt anymore.</font>

130
00:11:09,040 --> 00:11:09,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry.</font>

131
00:11:10,920 --> 00:11:12,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I failed to protect you.</font>

132
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:14,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you think about it, it's alright.</font>

133
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Jun Qinglan today</font>

134
00:11:16,880 --> 00:11:17,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is no longer that sheltered lady</font>

135
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:19,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from the inner chambers.</font>

136
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:23,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'll be your shield from now on.</font>

137
00:11:23,760 --> 00:11:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you</font>

138
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:26,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just need to be happy</font>

139
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:28,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and remain my sweet little dumpling.</font>

140
00:11:42,880 --> 00:11:43,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How beautiful.</font>

141
00:11:44,520 --> 00:11:46,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, so beautiful.</font>

142
00:11:50,260 --> 00:11:54,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪If you haven't gone far, let me see♪</font>

143
00:11:54,510 --> 00:11:57,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Your clear eyes once more♪</font>

144
00:11:58,510 --> 00:12:04,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this long, cold night,
only you bring warmth♪</font>

145
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:06,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

146
00:12:08,160 --> 00:12:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let's forget the past</font>

147
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:11,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and start anew.</font>

148
00:12:11,520 --> 00:12:14,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drenching my eyes♪</font>

149
00:12:14,800 --> 00:12:16,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll definitely help
with your brother's case.</font>

150
00:12:18,640 --> 00:12:19,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changle is a malignant tumor</font>

151
00:12:19,520 --> 00:12:21,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that must be removed in Beiyuan.</font>

152
00:12:21,560 --> 00:12:22,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once she is gone,</font>

153
00:12:23,400 --> 00:12:24,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your brother will be free.</font>

154
00:12:27,280 --> 00:12:28,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you'll have nothing to worry about.</font>

155
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:33,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

156
00:12:34,520 --> 00:12:37,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">people write their most cherished wishes</font>

157
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on these Kongming Lanterns.</font>

158
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:41,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But how many of those wishes
actually come true?</font>

159
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:44,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The lanterns' light is fleeting.</font>

160
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The next morning,</font>

161
00:12:46,720 --> 00:12:48,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we still have to face reality.</font>

162
00:12:50,280 --> 00:12:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Life's meetings and partings
are like this.</font>

163
00:12:52,640 --> 00:12:53,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's enjoy the time we have together.</font>

164
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:57,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If everyone thought the way you do,</font>

165
00:12:58,680 --> 00:13:00,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then we wouldn't have
even a moment's joy.</font>

166
00:13:03,040 --> 00:13:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me some time to think.</font>

167
00:13:05,810 --> 00:13:09,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this long, cold night,
only you bring warmth♪</font>

168
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't keep me waiting too long.</font>

169
00:13:14,140 --> 00:13:18,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪If you could feel the rain
falling on the world♪</font>

170
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:21,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drenching my eyes♪</font>

171
00:13:22,570 --> 00:13:28,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's draw closer beneath the stars♪</font>

172
00:14:05,280 --> 00:14:06,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fetch the physician!</font>

173
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:07,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince is having an episode.</font>

174
00:14:39,880 --> 00:14:40,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

175
00:14:42,160 --> 00:14:43,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't go.</font>

176
00:14:44,040 --> 00:14:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm here.</font>

177
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:46,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't leave.</font>

178
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you leave,</font>

179
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:49,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will slaughter everyone here.</font>

180
00:14:51,520 --> 00:14:52,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You never change.</font>

181
00:14:57,040 --> 00:14:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun,</font>

182
00:14:58,000 --> 00:14:59,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Prince never allows anyone near him</font>

183
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for his daily care.</font>

184
00:15:00,880 --> 00:15:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please help wipe him down.</font>

185
00:15:15,280 --> 00:15:16,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've seen all kinds of bare bodies.</font>

186
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's there to fear?</font>

187
00:15:59,880 --> 00:16:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I suggest you stop right there.</font>

188
00:16:07,680 --> 00:16:08,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

189
00:16:08,560 --> 00:16:10,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should drink your medicine first.</font>

190
00:16:13,280 --> 00:16:13,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

191
00:16:29,520 --> 00:16:30,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is this medicine sweet?</font>

192
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:33,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could it be sweet?</font>

193
00:16:39,560 --> 00:16:40,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's clearly very bitter.</font>

194
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:42,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, we share the same bitterness.</font>

195
00:16:56,200 --> 00:16:58,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Princess Changle's Mansion]</font>

196
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ungrateful wretch.</font>

197
00:17:13,600 --> 00:17:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

198
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have something to report.</font>

199
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Speak.</font>

200
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:20,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">While you were in secluded meditation,</font>

201
00:17:20,880 --> 00:17:22,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the head of Nightfall Haven
used your name</font>

202
00:17:22,560 --> 00:17:23,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to conduct secret dealings
with merchants</font>

203
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:25,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and line his pockets.</font>

204
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:29,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How should we deal with him?</font>

205
00:17:30,160 --> 00:17:31,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill him.</font>

206
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:33,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

207
00:17:34,120 --> 00:17:34,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then,</font>

208
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:36,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who will manage Nightfall Haven?</font>

209
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:41,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come. Let's find someone
who will truly serve me.</font>

210
00:17:46,980 --> 00:17:48,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

211
00:17:49,860 --> 00:17:51,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

212
00:17:51,520 --> 00:17:54,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

213
00:17:55,440 --> 00:17:59,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

214
00:18:00,130 --> 00:18:03,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

215
00:18:04,110 --> 00:18:08,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

216
00:18:08,630 --> 00:18:12,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

217
00:18:12,970 --> 00:18:18,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

218
00:18:21,100 --> 00:18:25,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

219
00:18:25,770 --> 00:18:29,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

220
00:18:29,820 --> 00:18:34,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

221
00:18:34,370 --> 00:18:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

222
00:18:38,340 --> 00:18:42,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

223
00:18:42,950 --> 00:18:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
